ZeCCKpUl6JeMEiFalO9-5k4gbHtXqdKgit1lEgtzLLfQade5eU_Vhtg48M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7v2UoLXntiTlmeW5CX6ndLioyGOmWSlEKCb_NYgaQTiQ&oe=6A1D8704"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00001.png", "id": "27075490678749478", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_27075490692082810_46830551376919340_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K27_hBazxwIQ7kNvwF2dbeX&_nc_oc=Adq-niGS2fCwBbV-7TVUtM_zwx6TuGmZruUfvnHAiA7UvzrH92Xfjg22nNO59zqXLKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af742gytMWs6KziqjIf5IclwpP1o04UIkDzTUmtlSDgImg&oe=6A1D8487"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Package Unit Installation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Package Unit Installation is an immersive VR training application designed to simulate real-world installation procedures for HVAC package units. Learners engage in step-by-step, hands-on scenarios covering equipment positioning, connections, safety protocols, and system checks in a risk-free virtual environment.\nThis application is an integral component of the ImmerseLearn HVAC Package Unit Installation micro-credential program. It is not a standalone product access is exclusively granted to individuals enrolled in the program, ensuring a guided and structured learning experience.\nThrough interactive VR modules, users develop practical skills, improve accuracy, and build confidence before performing tasks in real-world settings. Ideal for aspiring technicians and professionals seeking experiential HVAC training.", "short_description": "Experience hands-on HVAC training in VR with the HVAC Package Unit Installation app. This simulation is part of the ImmerseLearn micro-credential program and provides guided, real-world installation practice. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program for structured, immersive skill development."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_